From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(gemini): carry tool_call_id into functionCall/functionResponse

An OpenAI request on the Gemini-native path (antigravity /
claude-opus-4-6-thinking) emitted functionCall parts with no id, so the
upstream Vertex-Anthropic converter saw an id-less tool_result and returned
400 "messages.0.content.0.tool_result.tool_use_id: Field required". Every
tool round-trip 400d, which also killed the reviewer worker (its handoff
never completed).

